00:08:42.288 --> 00:08:43.489
that kind of investigation right now.

00:08:43.489 --> 00:08:44.257
But in conjunction

00:08:44.257 --> 00:08:45.958
with the RCMP, Canada's

00:08:45.958 --> 00:08:46.826
national police force,

00:08:46.826 --> 00:08:50.162
and in fact, the FBI and U.S.

00:08:50.162 --> 00:08:51.264
forces as well.

00:08:51.264 --> 00:08:53.666
So was it

00:08:53.666 --> 00:08:55.568
the same kind of object

00:08:55.568 --> 00:08:56.769
that was shot down over

00:08:56.769 --> 00:08:58.170
Alaska by the United States?

00:08:58.170 --> 00:08:59.238
Might have been.

00:08:59.238 --> 00:09:01.974
I think many questions right now would be

00:09:02.575 --> 00:09:03.876
that the minister, Anita

00:09:03.876 --> 00:09:04.911
Anand, went out of her way

00:09:04.911 --> 00:09:05.811
to say to us, Jim,

00:09:05.811 --> 00:09:07.079
that this was unprecedented

00:09:07.079 --> 00:09:08.314
and unprecedented action

00:09:08.314 --> 00:09:09.649
on the part of Norway

00:09:09.649 --> 00:09:11.484
to shoot something like this down

00:09:12.451 --> 00:09:15.021
over Canadian airspace.

00:09:15.021 --> 00:09:17.223
The question she did not answer

00:09:17.456 --> 00:09:18.491
was whether or not

00:09:18.491 --> 00:09:20.026
they had seen

00:09:20.026 --> 00:09:22.395
objects like this before in their radar.

00:09:22.728 --> 00:09:23.696
She went on to say,

00:09:23.696 --> 00:09:24.630
obviously, that they're going

00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:25.831
to be really beefing up

00:09:25.831 --> 00:09:26.699
their surveillance.

00:09:26.699 --> 00:09:27.934
There that does involve

00:09:27.934 --> 00:09:30.603
an entire new security infrastructure

00:09:30.603 --> 00:09:30.870
up there

00:09:30.870 --> 00:09:32.438
that they have been working on for years.

00:09:32.438 --> 00:09:33.105
But also, Jim,

00:09:33.105 --> 00:09:33.773
want to point out

00:09:33.773 --> 00:09:35.841
something that Secretary Austin said

00:09:36.208 --> 00:09:37.577
after meeting

00:09:37.677 --> 00:09:39.512
with Defense Minister

00:09:39.512 --> 00:09:41.814
Ananda in Washington just yesterday

00:09:42.048 --> 00:09:43.382
and that he referenced

00:09:43.382 --> 00:09:46.252
the increasing assertiveness of China.

00:09:46.552 --> 00:09:48.454
Now, while they were talking about China

00:09:48.454 --> 00:09:49.689
because of the spy balloon

00:09:49.689 --> 00:09:50.823
that was shot down off

00:09:50.823 --> 00:09:52.725
the Carolina coast,

00:09:52.725 --> 00:09:54.193
at issue is that they know

00:09:54.193 --> 00:09:55.528
they have other actors

00:09:55.528 --> 00:09:58.464
in the Arctic Russia being just one.

00:09:58.998 --> 00:10:01.534
And they do see a more robust

00:10:01.534 --> 00:10:03.169
defense structure

00:10:03.169 --> 00:10:05.071
that needs to be put in place there.

00:10:05.071 --> 00:10:06.439
But I thought that language was quite

00:10:06.439 --> 00:10:07.239
strong on

00:10:07.239 --> 00:10:08.674
the part of the secretary saying

00:10:08.674 --> 00:10:10.443
it was Anita Anand together.

00:10:10.443 --> 00:10:13.112
That is is this this assertiveness

00:10:13.279 --> 00:10:14.347
that bothers them.

00:10:14.347 --> 00:10:16.315
So certainly a menacing factor.

00:10:16.315 --> 00:10:16.882
Now, three

00:10:16.882 --> 00:10:18.284
objects, high

00:10:18.284 --> 00:10:21.287
altitude and taking action on all three.

